    thinking: "**Confirming Compile Success**\n\nThe compile was flawless, zero warnings! I\'m thrilled with the outcome. Now I\'m shifting focus to ensuring there aren\'t any unnecessary files floating around after the process. Double-checking file management is key now.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have completed the personal website and multi-column blog directory for **shreeharsha.com**. The application compiles cleanly with zero warnings, presenting a customized, architectural aesthetic that reflects your systems-engineer profile.\n\n### \360\237\216\250 Design Concept & Visuals\nThe platform is styled using a high-contrast **Charcoal & Zinc** scheme integrated with responsive layout accents to convey your operational philosophy.\n* **Typographical Harmony**: Imported a custom triad of Google Fonts:\n  * **Plus Jakarta Sans** as the clean, editorial sans-serif face for interface actions and section headings.\n  * **JetBrains Mono** applied to structural indices, locations, elevation matrices, and system metadata.\n  * **Noto Sans Kannada** to render Kannada characters with authentic, eye-safe weights.\n* **Architectural Spacing**: Configured with spacious margins and subtle responsive grid lines, allowing the content to serve as the dominant visual weight.\n* **Purposeful Transitions**: Loaded with subtle entry alignments, staggered component cards, and smooth state-fades during navigation.\n\n---\n\n### \360\237\247\251 Core Modules\n\n#### 1. Interactive Profile Section\n* Direct translation of your ChatGPT profile: **\"Builder first, thinker second, operator always.\"**\n* Shows your systems diagram and active transition metrics, demonstrating a clear shift from workflow automation to foundational intelligence systems.\n* Highlights actual projects under your command: **Edmin** (compliance engine), **Symphony Admin Panel Gen** (architecture-first compilers), and **Conversational Slate** (agentic UI platform).\n\n#### 2. Multi-Directory Blog Engine\n* Cohesive, instant-search-enabled browser serving three distinct content registers:\n  1. **Tech Blog**: Detailed articles discussing your real-world architecture viewpoints (agentic state canvas orchestration, deterministic relational code synthesis, and compiling functional DAG compliance workflows).\n  2. **Kannada Blog (\340\262\225\340\262\250\340\263\215\340\262\250\340\262\241 \340\262\254\340\263\215\340\262\262\340\262\276\340\262\227\340\263\215)**: Custom Kannada-language essays (e.g., local language semantic models, Malenadu trail reflections, and world model theories), paired with a togglable English translation overview.\n  3. **Travel Blog**: Monsoon trekking logs and geometric historical audits of Kudremukh, Hampi, and Belur.\n* Special features include dedicated geographic panels parsing altitude, coordinates, and regions for travel entries.\n\n#### 3. State-Machine Contact Compiler\n* Features form inputs customized for your professional work: **Intent Criteria** (Intelligence Infrastructure, Product Tooling, Systems Audit) and **Priority Weights** (Routine, Urgent, Critical Infrastructure).\n* Animates a local state transaction upon submission, printing a physical confirmation slip and safely persisting entries via browser storage.\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 1
      nanos: 137491519
    }
