    summary: "Rootent, officially known as ROOTENT TECHNOLOGIES PRIVATE LIMITED, is an Indian tech company founded on August 19, 2016, and headquartered in Bengaluru (Bangalore).[1][2][3][4][5]\n\nThe company specializes in providing IT solutions for software application development, with a focus on AI-driven solutions and custom web application development. Their expertise includes blockchain technology, Ethereum smart contracts, web3, Hyperledger, UI/UX web designing using platforms like Angular, Vue, and jQuery, and mobile application development. Rootent aims to improve operational efficiency, enhance customer engagement, and leverage business intelligence for its clients.[1][4]\n\nThe co-founders of Rootent are Ranjith Kadamboor and Shreeharsha Perla.[1] Other listed directors include Kadamboor Harikrishna Ranjith, Kaushik Sesha Srinand, and Pallathadka Shreeharsha.[3][5]\n\nAs of March 2026, Rootent is an unfunded company.[1] For the financial year ending March 31, 2025, the company reported a revenue of \342\202\27125.3 lakhs, showing a compounded annual growth rate (CAGR) of 16% over the last year.[2] Rootent Technologies Private Limited is currently active.[2][3][5]\n\nSources:\n[1] [tracxn.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFvjaOZBqkKPwyK696X51OduUEkWH1QdyNJLgB0jr1GNH4zzvJIdCZiB75UK5M_lTymOfF9wm5qt93xro3km-DlNihei-iQh4gPEwUWxW6yRH9ozYeW_Sqbwpy1z7pLwPpzsnSED2y1YrugYWoFrllnEZZlJK7fAlZ9RZXhaWp2XYUxOeJsK0QhmJ4ueNWGFw==)\n[2] [tracxn.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHio4ytEPKy6_bdUF69bjKoiahi9mAPlWvFRmewVVQEMX5ea9gM14FmMJJogA3cfEFd93Kn6C31lPBxrdYrx5QzqANjizQvO1ZjnqQPHESeY0ahJr7clo21MSMtK3LP1C3uUcTHTdDEk1EcdqUKO57V3D3umo2hh1Bw_YTqsk6oc97aVaUWixyBIXJZzRUGvaHkxx_3V5DblDcpue4SqERZ7IPWxNW0khEL5gocRbB_n2DOOw0FTbI=)\n[3] [thecompanycheck.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFpmjur5VeYWnQ1gZufy1XCr4AZx-kuVRpn4l4CR-mKxJUsF6AoB6cvRSE_BTnn1-b5PGxh9kVyM_304Q