    summary: "Rootent Technologies Private Limited is an active private limited company headquartered in Bangalore, Karnataka, India. The company was incorporated on August 19, 2016[1][2][3][4][5].\n\nRootent Technologies specializes in AI-driven solutions and custom web application development, offering services in application development and software solutions within the information and communication sector[1][6]. Their expertise includes blockchain technology, Ethereum smart contracts, web3, Hyperledger, UI/UX web design using Angular, Vue, and jQuery, and mobile application development[7].\n\nThe company maintains a career profile on Instahyre, identifying itself as a trusted technology partner in Bangalore[6].\n\nRootent Technologies Private Limited has an authorized capital of INR 1.00 lac and a paid-up capital of INR 1.00 lac[2][3][4][5]. Directors of the company include Kadamboor Harikrishna Ranjith, Kaushik Sesha Srinand, and Pallathadka Shreeharsha[1][2][3][5].\n\nTheir registered addresses in Bangalore include:\n*   No 309/5, Jk Pride, 40Th Cross, 8Th Block, Jayanagar, Bangalore South, Karnataka, 560070[1].\n*   FLAT NO. #A-107, ADITHYA ELAN, NEW TEMPLE ROAD, NALLURAHALLI, WHITEFIELD, BANGALORE, Bangalore, Karnataka - 560066[2][3][4][5][8].\n\nIn the financial year ending March 31, 2025, Rootent Technologies Private Limited generated a revenue of \342\202\27125.3L[3]. The company also experienced significant growth in revenue (2364.24%) and profitability (346.04%) for the financial year 2019[1]. Rootent has also been listed as a client of Suvidha Talent, a scalable workforce partner for Indian enterprises[9].\n\nSources:\n[1] [thecompanycheck.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFFvB646g05FETwxPIf0wjN7r0t0UWfdxI1WS209TRm8WpKxJhVp_3gpazjEYWuJsqTUAA1AIdLr0AabXXLQGkTHTuER06QC1hKhLRPHOsAHju4-0V0kOa70VYZEjetBk5bypMS2k7wDqXtgiZjK9amT072VznqGahhXDh52o2mQ8ikACquwyjwVsYn1Q7ZIlrBilJGLa15R-OaXAUN)\n[2] [tofler.in](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHg9R2U6ba4d41TCXhw2Mym4wAygUVyhTEf11MDrrWNsUHtnY0TGe9a1XiqYgqKc-nj-KyMERckOYJcg5EH21cwSdwOqpdcxgquGryfXz0EfqHD2FEyXTRyeQ9B2B5QO2HnogwNQhh3869l4uZS5CZ1kTN0rVqCMh-Dq9aMSbqan2CPg1NY0mBIQ6Xa7jlVgFZoJkA=)\n[3] [tracxn.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFUfmlTJdp3B5IcWcGTAqYN6MwYQFmIFhIMP1FxTc6ZOhvRPXp2sDezfU6VkyUEAQZICfU9UJr4IkYBjLeYceLuDQJvc7OI--J9iZ3rDbRcgviYp2GuKQifuizvfHoNNYbUlmK8uS4I44ofpUKIhIj6jWYH2BV5YfUOnB3oZkmebIxt5CxjWk7OHrBpOvnVZxUyZkZ9McB_aNnVz3ycU_GdS0xAUWR-iQHfEh_W2JJYlPQu-Tm8Ezo=)\n[4] [economictimes.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHZfS8Y1DWYNKi3bQ5_agseIh4AjVh0gJ2m4gcKOCiYE0iLwol9U7KThKwq3YUvvLYLba5VyQJOyDmgRxJLsLl7HsO49mFzNGPa7jmdjhrAraYleTPIM9EpXtbdJkGLqKj3FQ0holreNrwcNp4CdOspWNg6eh1_sXlO5Uypkb6r1E91ETNpphVH6nJb1L4bkE-WgezNvV617ag=)\n[5] [zaubacorp.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEtL27doa4zedGf_dWyXmlxZQCv4-YVAUcU1puWnjaAdd0u68HFbPdgSv1uT4p_ack65GEdLjnt5JToTT9cUvDYMyx2dzE5kPH_a4b4ROFosPl3RbeutN-J5zewJ95nb7L3vTzSGmn1uEyNq9ZHKxchjRAUGXJ1wFoBX711SEPW1fQoguHd8SfC_g9sOx0rPw==)\n[6] [instahyre.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFMRhBSQvwX7-R0VM_quNLk45PT74KKUgHcmXjDJ8tbrg1THQWrD8tlEVA-Tv0zfcAlEyFYG0XSBc5mLnr44EX9bykyS5bCzIOpNR_D4XHoMbAZI9T-6YBkm8gbSE0qYh66HiMrKbTLjk-UcOp3MNvHQu4=)\n[7] [tracxn.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGswjcGDm18upsuIdz-Xf59ehGP_0lpzzphm9KgF1QcVj98awJ9taIqcO4MGn0GpMVhy48QSqhcLzXKxs6bQ9NyxJiYPhu8hLmBRy9E4lNNW37dnSIxcI_AwRS5XBy61q9JQtBcCA9p0AdJdGmrbKRmuW0R4i8QnAJyQXl1uLPzgSHOPYcyzfdBikwugZhN8Q==)\n[8] [filesure.in](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGHrWrYIFQwqyxu3RJhUXc5nHele4iokFB0ctN7tm3P0SXR6qpUaiqYGb3oQ6OVFwHgyOTAoiP6rHDxTcmNnK52JSeWH8aMGskwCg4F0jlkT6sO4nVl3pVqRrToCKd4fYndmiYxT4tJp6MfnXXXyfrD5WgW6Ryvz7wHaXz6yyAhfXsVDWze1courhmcFGFblh-WH2-tutD68YnL