    summary: "Rootent Technologies Private Limited is an active, unfunded private limited company based in Bengaluru, Karnataka, India, founded in 2016 by Ranjith Kadamboor and Shreeharsha Perla.[1][2][3][4][5][6]\n\nThe company operates as an IT solutions provider specializing in AI-driven solutions and custom web application development. Rootent Technologies focuses on developing products related to blockchain technology, including Ethereum smart contracts, web3, and Hyperledger. They also offer UI/UX web design using platforms like Angular, Vue, and jQuery, and engage in mobile application development.[1][7] Their aim is to enhance operational efficiency, boost customer engagement, and unlock business intelligence for businesses across various industries by delivering tailored, end-to-end digital solutions.[7]\n\nRootent Technologies utilizes Instahyre as a platform for career opportunities and job postings.[7] The company\'s focus on specialized, custom solutions and its relatively small employee count (4 as of July 2024) suggest it operates in a manner consistent with a \"boutique\" technology firm.[1][7]\n\nSources:\n[1] [tracxn.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGKc0rTXIVosZr3jlZFmRCcHFxi5ObpglbwHVxrRv2Mcl_Vf-s-KijkBJyvLmMcrftsYgjSAuuRhcD3CF3Lf5XbebhUB7sGLb__NyEagTBDaOWOunOfvyn7PuThBGdg-mFgFwcCykH_dUrCndxOn3Du9onFifQSu-g9SKH3vnjohUGe5b9YZ_BYLii1KklU)\n[2] [thecompanycheck.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQERwgxLyaQGa6j-4aHWI4xsn0EqgaU_dQOjRGLz1g9SWu5a9l6yo7FzPjOqI9LyZhfd7znGgspYcKKh6FvUjHezDOzBPt-0HvCgbH9u_QadWYU3BRiGLp7MmsLqNzfdAyvfqdFYkGTwcE4dCwUnmK1MdRnx21qyuUOZtpkQJ6Mw4MXo4kVgtL9GsFtS1oho9xfMIX8kVTx42ogNIBM=)\n[3] [tracxn.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH3ImIkE-WBoSzU1SIZyurdVDS9Y1kGEZLlrUeuCk3Eii97_VCuW4dhFvE9z1h3W6pL0ILZpW2Mb2vqOnLSbEpJBOUmz_XjR8nUz7MmYCiWBpDWLkunnc02m5wWih5MhK2OyyGyW4vAyKZ4GxbRsqI734lFXlVUbD2qz6gg-K5pfNKFbZiEFeBeNEDJ