    summary: "Rootent Technologies Private Limited is an active private limited company based in Bangalore, Karnataka, India, specializing in application development and software solutions. The company was incorporated on August 19, 2016, and is registered with the Registrar of Companies in Bangalore.[1][2][3][4]\n\nKey details about Rootent Technologies Pvt Ltd:\n*   **Corporate Identification Number (CIN):** U74999KA2016PTC095841[1][5][2][3][4]\n*   **Registered Address:** FLAT NO. #A-107, ADITHYA ELAN, NEW TEMPLE ROAD, NALLURAHALLI, WHITEFIELD, Bangalore, BANGALORE, Karnataka, India, 560066.[1][5][3][4]\n*   **Business Activities:** The company\'s industry classification is \"Other Business Activities N.E.C.\"[1][5] and it is involved in \"Business Services\"[4], with a specific focus on \"application development & software solutions within the information and communication sector\" and providing \"IT solutions for software applications development\"[1][2].\n*   **Capital:** It has an authorized and paid-up capital of Rs. 100,000 (INR 1.00 lac).[1][5][2][3][4]\n*   **Directors:** The current board of directors includes Pallathadka Shreeharsha, Kadamboor Harikrishna Ranjith, and Kaushik Sesha Srinand.[1][5][2][3]\n*   **Financials:** Rootent Technologies Private Limited generated a revenue of Rs. 25.3 lakhs for the financial year ending March 31, 2025.[1]\n*   **Website:** The company\'s website is rootent.com.[1]\n\nSources:\n[1] [tracxn.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFM3v9lFxyGGTj0i2Jizc-ZMXXuUf4qh_HyxkwkGQovUXIDwwgtAQy1klK7ivKuD6dWiNcFLhGg_Y_5LggTlIbli8ykDH8zqlpHl9HrXNvJNS4cp5lN1odzQp6303mXDaCQr9Dz3ketY1fGpLH0MsFiEfnbG3W6vq4a8VqbncIAne9_SIaOBLn4jYLZmtrtCxQ5gEKG-Jst-_uqHpxZIKz5fG5GcwVbvknRfUs3SKs1O5EZwWEMkps=)\n[2] [thecompanycheck.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGTusAp67_8JpJbBN2vYsT-olzzvaRJIJgLg3hxGPmila13DWYk0si7BOpDUn7bcU4skCpT29M_jgd8myShWQPbD64ZtxeFwP9BYS4Ofj5-xsw9SxPHbh-