        lines {
          text: "              {/* Dynamic Narrative Statement */}"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "              <div className=\"bg-zinc-900/30 font-sans text-xs text-zinc-300 rounded-xl p-4.5 border border-zinc-800/30 leading-relaxed space-y-3 min-h-[145px] flex flex-col justify-between\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                <div>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  {activeTension === \'rigor\' && ("
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                    <p>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                      I constantly battle the urge to engineer flawless, generalized meta-compilers before shipping the first line of code. I break this gridlock with a personal ruleset: <strong className=\"text-white\">any abstraction that hasn&apos;t saved me from manual labor twice is a distraction.</strong> I schema-design rigorously, then bootstrap and ship immediate working loops."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                    </p>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  )}"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  {activeTension === \'heuristics\' && ("
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                    <p>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                      LLM code generation can construct beautiful visual facades, but they disintegrate under load. I refuse to ship unanchored software. <strong className=\"text-white\">We pipe intelligence inside strict state enclosures.</strong> Models are permitted to map data, but our compilers and database schemas must completely bound system drifts."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                    </p>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  )}"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  {activeTension === \'isolation\' && ("
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                    <p>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                      High-assurance systems are compiled in sustained periods of focused solitude, debugging traces and postgres indexes. But isolated brains lose system grounding. I force myself out of the darkroom to anchor Bengaluru&apos;s dev networks\342\200\224nurturing literature, sourdough chemistry, and local developer hubs."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                    </p>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "                  )}"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
