  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Reviewing Application Aesthetics**\n\nI\'m pleased to report the application compiled successfully! We\'ve made excellent progress on the color scheme, addressing the objective to replace harsh borders and dark filters with more gentle gray tones. The visual performance is now truly exceptional, and the application\'s overall presentation is quite clean.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have successfully completed the visual and structural refinements for **shreeharsha.com**:\n\n### Core Visual Transformations & Refinements\n\n- **Soft Gray Aesthetic & Restructured Boundaries**: \n  - Substituted absolute blacks (`zinc-950` backgrounds) and raw white borders with elegant charcoal grays (`#18181c`, `zinc-900/40`) to create a balanced, cohesive visual atmosphere.\n  - Reconstructed interactive components, including the **Beyond the Abstraction** dashboards (Cooking, Watching, Magic, and Social) and the **Strategic Trajectory Shift** panels, with low-contrast, dual-density borders (`border-zinc-800/25`) to eliminate visual clutter.\n  - Soothed the **Interactive Pipeline Compiler** controls, dynamic dropdown selections, filter tags, and text fields within the contact and blog hubs into fluid offset backings.\n\n- **Precise Domain Branding**:\n  - Implemented the branding format strictly across all primary interfaces: **SHREE** is rendered in light gray partnered seamlessly with **HARSHA** in pure white capital display typography.\n\n- **Systems Architecture Mindset**:\n  - Maintained the focus on Shreeharsha\'s strategic shift toward intelligence infrastructure, developer tools, and operational execution rather than simple application showcases.\n  - Kept the visual hierarchy clean, high-contrast, yet eye-safe, preserving standard light-transmitting highlights during interaction.\n"
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 908028862
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
